    {
      "id": "lKRbjWOYm9dQK7iJI8So3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 717,
      "y": 237.5,
      "width": 731.5595703125,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2097581609,
      "version": 793,
      "versionNonce": 400621927,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787844580096,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - cache in form of {key: value} pair\n    - How much capacity of cache ?\n    - Least Recently Used - remove the least lastly used\n    - operations : get(key), put(key, value)\n    - return null for key is not there in cache\n    - get, put on existing key then make recently used, moved to top/front\n    - get, put on O(1)\n\n2. Entities:\n    - Need for fast lookup and updates - HashMap(Key: Node)\n    - Need for fast tracking\n        - Most used/new comes at front\n        - least used at last and remove if capacity exceeds\n        - add/delete/move all at O(1)\n        = Doubly LinkedList\n    - LRUCache, DoublyLinkedList, HashMap, Node\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - cache in form of {key: value} pair\n    - How much capacity of cache ?\n    - Least Recently Used - remove the least lastly used\n    - operations : get(key), put(key, value)\n    - return null for key is not there in cache\n    - get, put on existing key then make recently used, moved to top/front\n    - get, put on O(1)\n\n2. Entities:\n    - Need for fast lookup and updates - HashMap(Key: Node)\n    - Need for fast tracking\n        - Most used/new comes at front\n        - least used at last and remove if capacity exceeds\n        - add/delete/move all at O(1)\n        = Doubly LinkedList\n    - LRUCache, DoublyLinkedList, HashMap, Node\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
